# Documentation is TRACKED. `Docs/` was ignored wholesale, which hid all 25
# numbered documents — the proposal, the SAD, the architecture and MCP
# references, the whole preprocessing record and every status report — on one
# laptop, invisible to teammates, mentors and evaluators and backed up by
# nothing. All of it is 688 KB of Markdown.
#
# What genuinely does not belong in git is the 46 MB of third-party PDFs, which
# is what made the blanket rule look reasonable in the first place.
Docs/**/*.pdf
Docs/Research Papers/

